    "title": "Pushing for a data center ban in La Crosse County with Manock and Mader - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rick Solem ,\n1 days ago An 18-month data center ban in La Crosse is on the docket for the county board. The moratorium legislation comes as a county study committee has its first meeting Wednesday. Dillon Mader and Lia Manock joined the Rick Solem Show on Tuesday to break down their reasonings for a moratorium, discuss the work the study committee will be doing, and why they feel a ban on data centers is necessary. Read full article\n3",
